ot a neuron importance score.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Blue: weight moves UP. Orange: DOWN. Thickness: gradient magnitude, not a neuron importance score.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Blue: weight moves UP. Orange: DOWN. Thickness: gradient magnitude, not a neuron importance score."}, {"id": "exact-weight-0055", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2274, "width": 1880, "height": 26.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 510055, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 520055, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0t", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Convolution shares filter weights across pixels. Only this 4-to-4 classifier is drawn as all 16 individual connections.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Convolution shares filter weights across pixels. Only this 4-to-4 classifier is drawn as all 16 individual connections.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Convolution shares filter weights across pixels. Only this 4-to-4 classifier is drawn as all 16 individual connections."}, {"id": "exact-weight-0056", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2350, "width": 1880, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 510056, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 520056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0u", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "2. Matrix multiplication: W @ a + b = logits", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2. Matrix multiplication: W @ a + b = logits", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "2. Matrix multiplication: W @ a + b = logits"}, {"id": "exact-weight-0057", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2399, "width": 1880, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 510057, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 520057, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0v", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Rows of W are classes; columns are pooled features. This repeats one weighted sum for each class, not one image per row.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Rows of W are classes; columns are pooled features. This repeats one weighted sum for each class, not one image per row.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Rows of W are classes; columns are pooled features. This repeats one weighted sum for each class, not one image per row."}, {"id": "exact-weight-0058", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2450, "width": 610, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 510058, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 520058, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0w", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "W: 16 learned weights (NOT probabilities)", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "W: 16 learned weights (NOT probabilities)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "auto